  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Eddie Kam is a Hong Kong accountant and corporate executive who became chief executive of Get Nice Holdings. He studied accountancy and corporate governance at Hong Kong Polytechnic University. His career encompassed auditing, financial management and company-secretarial work before he served on the boards of businesses across several different industries.",
    "html": "<p>Eddie Kam is a Hong Kong accountant and corporate executive who became chief executive of Get Nice Holdings. He studied accountancy and corporate governance at Hong Kong Polytechnic University. His career encompassed auditing, financial management and company-secretarial work before he served on the boards of businesses across several different industries.</p>\r\n",
