  "long_biography": {
    "plain_text": "Accountant Eddie Kam has taken responsibility for scrutinising companies' financial reporting. At restaurant operator Happy City Holdings, he chairs the audit committee. Its remit includes reviewing internal controls, approving related-party transactions and meeting separately with management and external auditors.\n\nHe has also explained Get Nice's expansion into art exhibitions and trading. At its modern ceramics exhibition, he described plans to concentrate on modern Chinese art at relatively accessible prices. The display included Jingdezhen ceramics and Hong Kong ink paintings. Exhibitions and talks were already taking place at the group's branches; he presented physical auctions as a possible next step.",
    "html": "<p>Accountant Eddie Kam has taken responsibility for scrutinising companies' financial reporting. At restaurant operator Happy City Holdings, he chairs the audit committee. Its remit includes reviewing internal controls, approving related-party transactions and meeting separately with management and external auditors.</p>\r\n<p>He has also explained Get Nice's expansion into art exhibitions and trading. At its modern ceramics exhibition, he described plans to concentrate on modern Chinese art at relatively accessible prices. The display included Jingdezhen ceramics and Hong Kong ink paintings. Exhibitions and talks were already taking place at the group's branches; he presented physical auctions as a possible next step.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 99,
